ted coherently, though restart was not itself a public task requirement.","limitations":["The failure-path test injected a read exception through a context-managed substitute rather than provoking a real operating-system open failure or directly measuring descriptor counts. Source inspection and the successful 500-read constrained runs nevertheless provide coherent supporting evidence."]}
